Why this harness exists

From Fowler (Harness Engineering):



Agent = Model + Harness. Guides (feedforward) raise first-try quality; sensors (feedback) enable self-correction. Computational sensors run every change; inferential sensors are slower and probabilistic.

From Pocock (mattpocock/skills):



Small composable skills, TDD at agreed seams, checkable completion criteria, progressive disclosure — predictability of process, not of output.

From Addy Osmani / HumanLayer:



Every agent mistake becomes a permanent harness rule (the ratchet). Back-pressure (typecheck/test/fitness) wired into the stop loop beats hoping the model “remembers” docs.

DSA fitness addition: treat Data Structures & Algorithms quality of algorithm-bearing simulation code as a dedicated architecture-of-algorithms fitness category — golden cases, complexity budgets, structure choice, invariants — and place it as the final computational gate so the agent cannot claim done on a wrong or asymptotically broken algorithm.



