DSA runner algorithm





Discover cases under cases/



For each case: load candidate (repo module or --target snippet)



Run golden fixtures → assert equality



Run N randomized/property inputs vs reference.py (differential)



Instrument op-count / wall time vs spec.yaml budgets



AST/structure probe: required types present (heapq, deque, etc.) when declared



Run invariants.py



Aggregate; if any fail, emit DSA remediation block last in the report

Complexity measurement (practical, not asymptotic proof)





Prefer instrumented op counters (compare/heap push) over wall-clock alone



Wall-clock as soft budget (CI variance)



Scale inputs {n=100, 1k, 10k}; fail if growth exceeds declared family by configured factor



